DECLARE `reg 22.01: Entry of the Schedule` HAS
    `Country`   IS A STRING
    `Agreement` IS A STRING

GIVEN country IS A STRING
      agreement IS A STRING
GIVETH A `reg 22.01: Entry of the Schedule`
`oa3: schedule row` country agreement MEANS
    `reg 22.01: Entry of the Schedule` WITH `Country` IS country, `Agreement` IS agreement

